        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 531,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": null,
        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "Figure 37  For non-uniform grids central approximation reduce locally to first order accuracy"
      },
      {
        "container_path": "_staging/total-read/model-audit/XBeach/connectivity/nonhydro-read/body-field-recovery/body-cached.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 12656,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 532,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 190,
        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "A consequence of using non-uniform grids is that locally the central approximations reduce to first order accuracy (Hirsch, 2007). As long as the changes in the grid are not sudden the error made is still substantially smaller than those made in a forward or backward difference scheme. Smooth grid transitions can be achieved using an expansion parameter"
      }
    ],
    "following_nonempty_paragraphs": [
      {
        "container_path": "_staging/total-read/model-audit/XBeach/connectivity/nonhydro-read/body-field-recovery/body-cached.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 12725,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 534,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 192,
        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "When the expansion (or contraction) parameter r is close to unity the first order truncation error made will indeed be small and the scheme is of almost second order. The use of a smoothly varying grid as described in equation (2.2) also creates a smooth transition between zones with a fine grid resolution and regions where a coarser grid is appropriate."
      },
      {
        "container_path": "_staging/total-read/model-audit/XBeach/connectivity/nonhydro-read/body-field-recovery/body-cached.docx",
        "member": "word/document.xml",
        "start_xml_ordinal": 12740,
        "body_paragraph_zero_based": 535,
        "direct_body_paragraph_zero_based": 193,
        "paragraph_id": null,
        "text": "Temporal grid"
      }
    ],
    "table_cell": null,
    "text_method": "Saved display-field substitution plus w:t; equation objects are not transcribed."
  },
